{"product_id":"the-fat-blocker-diet","title":"The Fat Blocker Diet","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere is a substance that can help us lose weight and lower cholesterol while we still enjoy satisfying foods. You don't need a prescription for it, and you can buy it in most health food stores. Unlike other popular diet pills, this product is not a drug and has absolutely no known side effects. It's an all-natural dietary fiber that absorbs the fat you eat. This supplement allows saturated fat to pass naturally through your system instead of taking up residence in your thighs, belly, or tush. It's that simple. When combined with the exclusive Fat Blocker program, this marvelous product can help you manage your weight and cholesterol with an ease you never thought possible. What is this miracle? It's the Fat Blocker. The Weight Is Over.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 146 x 235\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Brenda D. Adderly | Arnold Fox\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780312194529\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45894879346841,"sku":"17RD-4-9780312194529","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/3514083482299.jpg?v=1763132249","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-fat-blocker-diet","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}